{"seq":2,"slug":"anti-recursion-and-coordination","title":"防递归与协调","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/agents/multi-agent-patterns-and-recursion-guards/anti-recursion-and-coordination","wordCount":1278,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"防递归与协调\">防递归与协调</h1><p>多 agent 系统一旦放任不管，三种问题会同时来:<strong>递归无限派生</strong> (agent 派 agent 派 agent...) / <strong>race condition</strong> (两 teammate 同时 claim 同 task) / <strong>reverse-MCP 环路</strong> (personal-agent 工具 MCP server 又调 Claude 反向回来)。本文把工程纪律讲清——fork-can&#39;t-fork 的底层逻辑、message passing 的 atomic update、task list dependency 解锁、Tier 2 反向 MCP 的 reentry-guard、infinite-loop 防护套件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;  Risk[多 agent 风险]&#10;  Risk --&gt; R1[递归无限派生]&#10;  Risk --&gt; R2[Race condition: 双 claim]&#10;  Risk --&gt; R3[反向 MCP 环路]&#10;  Risk --&gt; R4[Infinite loop: 时间/数量超限]&#10;  R1 --&gt;|防| G1[fork-can&#39;t-fork + budget]&#10;  R2 --&gt;|防| G2[atomic task claim]&#10;  R3 --&gt;|防| G3[reentry-guard]&#10;  R4 --&gt;|防| G4[subagent/worktree/time budget]\">flowchart TB\n  Risk[多 agent 风险]\n  Risk --&gt; R1[递归无限派生]\n  Risk --&gt; R2[Race condition: 双 claim]\n  Risk --&gt; R3[反向 MCP 环路]\n  Risk --&gt; R4[Infinite loop: 时间/数量超限]\n  R1 --&gt;|防| G1[fork-can't-fork + budget]\n  R2 --&gt;|防| G2[atomic task claim]\n  R3 --&gt;|防| G3[reentry-guard]\n  R4 --&gt;|防| G4[subagent/worktree/time budget]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>触发场景</th>\n<th>防护机制</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>递归无限派生</td>\n<td>subagent 派 subagent 链式</td>\n<td>fork 一层硬限 + spawn budget</td>\n<td>runtime + settings</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Race condition</td>\n<td>多 teammate 抢 task</td>\n<td>task list atomic update</td>\n<td>Agent Teams 内核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向 MCP 环路</td>\n<td>MCP server 反调 Claude</td>\n<td>reentry-guard 同 call chain 限 1 层</td>\n<td>server 实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Infinite loop</td>\n<td>sub 跑超时 / worktree 爆</td>\n<td>budget 套件</td>\n<td>settings.json</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fork-can-t-fork-的底层逻辑\">fork-can&#39;t-fork 的底层逻辑</h2><p><a href=\"../subagent-fundamentals/fork-mode-and-prompt-cache\"><code>../1_subagent-fundamentals/2_fork-mode-and-prompt-cache.md</code></a> 提过 fork 不能再 fork 的硬规则。底层逻辑是 prompt cache 语义:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  P[Parent prompt + tools]&#10;  P --&gt;|fork OK| F1[Fork-1 cache HIT]&#10;  F1 --&gt;|期望 fork-2 是谁的 parent?| Q{歧义}&#10;  Q --&gt;|主 agent prompt?| Bad1[&quot;F1 自己的 turn 没进 cache → unpredictable&quot;]&#10;  Q --&gt;|F1 含 turn 的 prompt?| Bad2[&quot;F1 turn 让前缀差异化 → cache miss&quot;]&#10;  Bad1 --&gt; Block[Runtime BLOCK]&#10;  Bad2 --&gt; Block\">flowchart LR\n  P[Parent prompt + tools]\n  P --&gt;|fork OK| F1[Fork-1 cache HIT]\n  F1 --&gt;|期望 fork-2 是谁的 parent?| Q{歧义}\n  Q --&gt;|主 agent prompt?| Bad1[\"F1 自己的 turn 没进 cache → unpredictable\"]\n  Q --&gt;|F1 含 turn 的 prompt?| Bad2[\"F1 turn 让前缀差异化 → cache miss\"]\n  Bad1 --&gt; Block[Runtime BLOCK]\n  Bad2 --&gt; Block</pre><p>不论 fork-2 复用哪个 parent，cache invalidation 都变 unpredictable。Anthropic 选择在 runtime 硬禁第二层 fork，让 cache 语义保持简单:&quot;fork 永远命中 parent 的初始 prompt cache&quot;。需要更深嵌套用 spawn fresh，付正常 token 费且不依赖 cache。</p>\n<p>这条规则也是天然的 <strong>递归无限派生</strong> 防护——fork 链断在一层，攻击者或 buggy agent 想用 fork 无限派生不可能。但它只防 fork 路径，<strong>spawn fresh 不受限</strong>，需要额外的 subagent budget。</p>\n<h2 id=\"message-passing-协调-race-condition\">Message-passing 协调 race condition</h2><p>Agent Teams 多 teammate 并发场景的核心 race:两个 teammate 同时看到一个 pending task 都想 claim。错误的 naive 实现:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 错误: 非原子&#10;task = task_list.get(id)&#10;if task.status == &#39;pending&#39;:&#10;    task.owner = self.name        # race: 两个 teammate 同时跑到这&#10;    task.status = &#39;in_progress&#39;&#10;    task_list.put(task)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 错误: 非原子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">task </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task_list.get(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    task.owner </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># race: 两个 teammate 同时跑到这</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    task.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'in_progress'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    task_list.put(task)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>正确实现用 <strong>compare-and-swap (CAS)</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 正确: atomic compare-and-set&#10;success = task_list.atomic_claim(&#10;    id=task_id,&#10;    expected_status=&#39;pending&#39;,&#10;    new_owner=self.name,&#10;    new_status=&#39;in_progress&#39;,&#10;)&#10;if not success:&#10;    # 另一 teammate 已经 claim, 去下一个 task&#10;    continue\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 正确: atomic compare-and-set</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">success </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task_list.atomic_claim(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">task_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    expected_status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    new_owner</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    new_status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'in_progress'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> success:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 另一 teammate 已经 claim, 去下一个 task</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    continue</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>atomic_claim</code> 在底层是单条 update with WHERE 子句 (SQL / 文件 fcntl / Redis WATCH-MULTI-EXEC)，保证整个 list 任意时刻只有一个 claimer 成功。</p>\n<p>Teammate 间的 <strong>peer message</strong> 走 inbox file (JSONL append-only)，append 操作天然原子，多发不冲突。读端按时间戳 / 自增 id 顺序消费即可。整个 mesh-style 通信图:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant T1 as teammate-1&#10;  participant TL as task-list (atomic CAS)&#10;  participant IN as teammate-2 inbox JSONL&#10;  participant T2 as teammate-2&#10;  T1-&gt;&gt;TL: CAS claim t1 (pending -&gt; in_progress)&#10;  TL--&gt;&gt;T1: OK&#10;  T1-&gt;&gt;T1: 跑任务&#10;  T1-&gt;&gt;IN: append message {from: t1, to: t2, body: ...}&#10;  T2-&gt;&gt;IN: poll&#10;  IN--&gt;&gt;T2: 新 message&#10;  T2-&gt;&gt;T2: 处理 message\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant T1 as teammate-1\n  participant TL as task-list (atomic CAS)\n  participant IN as teammate-2 inbox JSONL\n  participant T2 as teammate-2\n  T1-&gt;&gt;TL: CAS claim t1 (pending -&gt; in_progress)\n  TL--&gt;&gt;T1: OK\n  T1-&gt;&gt;T1: 跑任务\n  T1-&gt;&gt;IN: append message {from: t1, to: t2, body: ...}\n  T2-&gt;&gt;IN: poll\n  IN--&gt;&gt;T2: 新 message\n  T2-&gt;&gt;T2: 处理 message</pre><h2 id=\"task-list-state-machine-的-dependency-解锁\">Task list state machine 的 dependency 解锁</h2><p>task list 三态 <code>pending</code> / <code>in_progress</code> / <code>completed</code> + 依赖字段:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- id: t1&#10;  subject: &#39;Add auth middleware to /api/admin/*&#39;&#10;  status: completed&#10;  owner: backend-agent&#10;  blocks: [t2, t3]&#10;&#10;- id: t2&#10;  subject: &#39;Update README with auth headers&#39;&#10;  status: pending # 依赖 t1 完成后由 lead AI 解锁&#10;  owner: docs-agent&#10;  blocked_by: [t1]&#10;&#10;- id: t3&#10;  subject: &#39;E2E test the protected route&#39;&#10;  status: pending&#10;  owner: qa-agent&#10;  blocked_by: [t1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">t1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Add auth middleware to /api/admin/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">completed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">backend-agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  blocks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">t2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">t3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">t2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Update README with auth headers'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pending</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 依赖 t1 完成后由 lead AI 解锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docs-agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  blocked_by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">t1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">t3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'E2E test the protected route'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pending</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">qa-agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  blocked_by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">t1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>blocked_by</code> 与 <code>blocks</code> 是双向关系——任一字段更新另一字段。机制是 push 而非 poll:<strong>t1 status 转 completed 时, lead AI 主动扫描 <code>t1.blocks</code>, 把每个被 blocked task 的 <code>blocked_by</code> 中去掉 t1, 当 <code>blocked_by</code> 空时自动 unblock</strong>。Teammate 不必轮询 task list 等待——unblock 是 lead AI 推过来的状态变更，teammate 收到通知再 CAS claim 即可。</p>\n<p>这套机制把 &quot;任务依赖图&quot; 当作 DAG，lead AI 做 topological 推进。循环依赖在创建 task 时被拒 (<code>blocks</code> + <code>blocked_by</code> 反向闭环检测)，避免 deadlock。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tier-2-反向-mcp-的-reentry-guard\">Tier 2 反向 MCP 的 reentry-guard</h2><p>反向 MCP 场景是这样:personal-agent 工具 (Hermes / OpenClaw 等 Tier 2) 注册自己为 MCP server, Claude 通过 mcp client 调用它的 tool。如果这个 server 内部又通过 Claude API 调 Claude (例如 server 想让 LLM 处理一段内容)，形成环路:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  C[Claude Code session]&#10;  C --&gt;|mcp call| S[&quot;Hermes MCP server (Tier 2)&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt;|&quot;内部 LLM 调用&quot;| Claude2[Claude API]&#10;  Claude2 -.-&gt;|结果| S&#10;  S -.-&gt;|tool result| C&#10;  C --&gt;|next turn 又 mcp call| S&#10;  S --&gt;|&quot;再次 LLM&quot;| Claude2&#10;  Claude2 --&gt;|&quot;server 又调 mcp call?&quot;| Loop[环路]\">flowchart LR\n  C[Claude Code session]\n  C --&gt;|mcp call| S[\"Hermes MCP server (Tier 2)\"]\n  S --&gt;|\"内部 LLM 调用\"| Claude2[Claude API]\n  Claude2 -.-&gt;|结果| S\n  S -.-&gt;|tool result| C\n  C --&gt;|next turn 又 mcp call| S\n  S --&gt;|\"再次 LLM\"| Claude2\n  Claude2 --&gt;|\"server 又调 mcp call?\"| Loop[环路]</pre><p>环路风险:server 在处理 mcp tool call 时调 Claude API，Claude API 输出又触发 server 调自己 (例如 prompt 里要求 Claude 调某 tool, server 误认为是自己的 tool)，无限递归 + token 烧光。</p>\n<p>防护机制是 <strong>reentry-guard</strong>:server 端给每个 mcp call 分配 call-chain-id，同一 call-chain 内最多允许 1 层 LLM 反向调用。最小实现思路:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"async def handle_tool_call(req):&#10;    chain_id = req.context.get(&#39;call_chain_id&#39;) or new_chain_id()&#10;    depth = req.context.get(&#39;mcp_depth&#39;, 0)&#10;&#10;    if depth &gt;= 1:&#10;        raise ReentryError(&quot;MCP reentry depth &gt; 1 in chain &quot; + chain_id)&#10;&#10;    # 传给内部 LLM 调用时带上 depth+1&#10;    result = await call_internal_llm(&#10;        prompt=...,&#10;        context={&#39;call_chain_id&#39;: chain_id, &#39;mcp_depth&#39;: depth + 1},&#10;    )&#10;    return result\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handle_tool_call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    chain_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> req.context.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'call_chain_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_chain_id()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> req.context.get(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mcp_depth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ReentryError(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MCP reentry depth > 1 in chain \"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chain_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 传给内部 LLM 调用时带上 depth+1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> call_internal_llm(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'call_chain_id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: chain_id, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mcp_depth'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>depth &gt;= 1</code> 时拒绝，硬规则。这是 server 实现的责任，不在 Claude 内核——Claude Code 不知道下游 MCP server 内部会不会反调自己，由 server 自己 guard。详细 reverse-MCP 反模式见 <a href=\"../../mcp/reverse-mcp-and-pitfalls/\"><code>../../2_mcp/3_reverse-mcp-and-pitfalls/</code></a>。</p>\n<p>更广的反向 MCP bridge 设计见 <a href=\"../../../bridges/\"><code>../../../03_bridges/</code></a> 桥接章节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"infinite-loop-防护套件\">Infinite-loop 防护套件</h2><p>settings.json 配置三个 budget:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;agentLimits&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;subagentPerSession&quot;: 20,&#10;    &quot;activeWorktrees&quot;: 8,&#10;    &quot;subagentTimeoutMinutes&quot;: 30&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"agentLimits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"subagentPerSession\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"activeWorktrees\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"subagentTimeoutMinutes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><strong>subagentPerSession</strong>:一个 main agent session 最多 N 个 subagent，超限拒绝派生。防 buggy agent 把 token 烧光。</li>\n<li><strong>activeWorktrees</strong>:同时存在的 worktree 上限，超过拒绝新派生 (sub 必须等其他完成 cleanup)。防 worktree 失控吃磁盘。</li>\n<li><strong>subagentTimeoutMinutes</strong>:subagent 跑 &gt; X 分钟自动 abort + cleanup。防 hung / loop 的 subagent 永远不回。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者叠加 + fork-can&#39;t-fork + reentry-guard，覆盖了 2026 多 agent 系统的主要无限派生 / 死循环风险。监控层面建议在 hooks 里 log 每次 subagent 派生 + 耗时 + worktree 状态，方便 audit。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><p>第一坑是依赖 fork-can&#39;t-fork 当全部防护——它只限 fork 路径，spawn fresh + 无 budget 一样可以失控。必须三件套都开。</p>\n<p>第二坑是 task list dependency 写循环——<code>t1 blocked_by [t2]</code>、<code>t2 blocked_by [t1]</code> 永远 deadlock。Lead AI 应在 task 创建时拒绝循环 (DAG 检测)，未检测的 Teams 实现可能挂死。</p>\n<p>第三坑是反向 MCP server 没 reentry-guard——server 作者只想着 &quot;我的 server 怎么处理 Claude 的请求&quot;，忘了 &quot;如果我内部也调 Claude&quot;，环路在生产里才暴露。Tier 2 personal-agent 工具开发者必须 review 这条。</p>\n<p>第四坑是 budget 设过紧——<code>subagentPerSession: 3</code> 在多并行 bug fix 场景一秒触顶，应根据团队工作流校准。生产环境给个宽松默认 + dashboard 监控比硬限更好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>四类风险:递归无限派生 / race condition / 反向 MCP 环路 / infinite loop</li>\n<li>fork-can&#39;t-fork 源于 prompt cache 语义歧义, 同时是天然递归防护; 但只防 fork 路径</li>\n<li>Race condition 用 atomic compare-and-swap claim, peer message 走 append-only JSONL inbox</li>\n<li>Task list state machine 三态 + dependency, lead AI push-driven unblock 而非 teammate poll</li>\n<li>Tier 2 反向 MCP <strong>必须</strong> 实现 reentry-guard, 同 call chain 限 1 层</li>\n<li>Infinite-loop 防护套件:subagent budget / worktree budget / time budget, settings.json 配</li>\n<li>单一防护不够, 多层组合才安全</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本 hub 完结。下一步参考 <a href=\"../../../workflows/\"><code>../../../03_workflows/</code></a> 学多 agent 在实际工作流中的编排, 或 <a href=\"../../mcp/reverse-mcp-and-pitfalls/\"><code>../../2_mcp/3_reverse-mcp-and-pitfalls/</code></a> 深入反向 MCP 风险。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"防递归与协调","id":"防递归与协调"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"fork-can't-fork 的底层逻辑","id":"fork-can-t-fork-的底层逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"Message-passing 协调 race condition","id":"message-passing-协调-race-condition"},{"level":2,"text":"Task list state machine 的 dependency 解锁","id":"task-list-state-machine-的-dependency-解锁"},{"level":2,"text":"Tier 2 反向 MCP 的 reentry-guard","id":"tier-2-反向-mcp-的-reentry-guard"},{"level":2,"text":"Infinite-loop 防护套件","id":"infinite-loop-防护套件"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多 agent 模式选型决策框架","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/agents/multi-agent-patterns-and-recursion-guards/when-to-use-each-pattern"},"next":null}